              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono ÖMÖNENE naabhaayë umutuurria harëbho na köbha na amaabhë igörö yaabho, na akabhamaahërra gikugira yi imuuma na Ibhurahimu, Isaka na Yakobho na taabhasikiri; gösë köbhatabhuta kurua kubhusiö bhooe kuhika reero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
